# Request/response logging — values come from Vault, do NOT put real Mongo credentials in this
# file. Shared by two libraries that read the exact same API_LOG_* keys: prime-service-x/
# servicelog (inbound requests that arrive here, via RequestLogMiddleware) and prime-service-x/
# apilog (outbound requests erp-core makes to other services, via
# internal/utils/NewOutboundLogTransport). One Init of each, both land in the same Mongo.
#
# API_LOG_EXCLUDE is a comma-separated list of path prefixes to skip (e.g. /cronjob/) for BOTH
# directions — read directly by erp-core (RequestLogMiddleware for inbound,
# internal/utils/outbound-log-transport.go for outbound), not by either library's own filtering
# (apilog v0.1.3's shouldLog() only ever runs for its inbound gin middleware, which erp-core does
# not use — its outbound LoggingTransport.RoundTrip never applies it, hence erp-core's own
# wrapper). Vault must include the cron self-calls here or they'll write to Mongo every minute:
# base_url_erp + "/credit/*" and "/emailAlert/*" (internal/services/cronjob-service/
# credit-request.go, "credit-request copy.go", credit-extra.go — 12 of the ~35 outbound clients).
# With base_url_erp = https://<host>/api/erp in this environment, that's:
#   API_LOG_EXCLUDE=/api/erp/credit/,/api/erp/emailAlert/
# (adjust the prefix to match whatever base_url_erp actually resolves to per environment — these
# calls are the only callers of base_url_erp in the whole repo, so this prefix cannot also exclude
# unrelated user-triggered traffic).
#
# API_LOG_INCLUDE / API_LOG_EXCLUDE_METHODS: both libraries' shouldLog() support these, but
# neither erp-core's inbound middleware nor its outbound wrapper implement them (only path-prefix
# exclude) — leave empty in Vault, they are no-ops here today.
#
# API_LOG_MAX_BODY_BYTES: how many bytes of request/response body apilog keeps per outbound log
# entry before truncating (see apilog/truncate.go) — leave empty to use apilog's own default
# (16384 bytes) unless Vault has a reason to change it.
API_LOG_ENABLED=
API_LOG_SERVICE=
API_LOG_MONGODB_URI=
API_LOG_DATABASE=
API_LOG_EXCLUDE=
API_LOG_EXCLUDE_METHODS=
API_LOG_INCLUDE=
API_LOG_MAX_BODY_BYTES=

